<title>UK: World rubber stocks rose in August - IRSG.</title>
<headline>World rubber stocks rose in August - IRSG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>World stocks of both natural and synthetic rubber rose in August 1996, by 60,000 and 10,000 tonnes, according to the International Rubber Study Group.</p>
<p>    Data in thousand tonnes -- AUG'96    JUL'96    AUG'95</p>
<p> Natural production		  550	 520	 490</p>
<p> Natural consumption		 490	 510	 470</p>
<p> Natural stocks		    1,590     1,530     1,570</p>
<p> Synthetic production		770	 800	 770</p>
<p> Synthetic consumption	     760	 760	 720</p>
<p> Synthetic stocks		  2,090     2,080     2,090</p>
<p>London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7771</p>
